-- src:3252 | (1) If the registrar decides in accordance with section 245 that a director‘s usual residential address is to be put on the public record, the registrar must proceed as if each relevant company had given notice under section 167H—
-- src:3253 | (a) stating a change in the director’s service address, and
-- src:3254 | (b) stating the director’s usual residential address as their new service address.
@ref s 246(1) the registrar proceeds as if each relevant company had given notice under s 167H (src:3252-3254)
GIVEN `the registrar has decided in accordance with section 245 that the director's usual residential address is to be put on the public record` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 246(1) the registrar must proceed as if each relevant company had given notice under section 167H` MEANS
    IF `the registrar has decided in accordance with section 245 that the director's usual residential address is to be put on the public record`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "If the registrar decides in accordance with section 245 that a director‘s usual residential address is to be put on the public record"

DECLARE `s 246(2) recipient of the notice` IS ONE OF
    `s 246(2)(a) the director`
    `s 246(2)(b) every relevant company`
    `s 246(2) someone else`

-- src:3255 | (2) The registrar must give notice of having done so—
-- src:3256 | (a) to the director, and
-- src:3257 | (b) to every relevant company.
@ref s 246(2) notice of having done so (src:3255-3257)
GIVEN recipient IS A `s 246(2) recipient of the notice`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 246(2) the registrar must give notice of having done so to the recipient` MEANS
    CONSIDER recipient
    WHEN `s 246(2)(a) the director` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 246(2)(b) every relevant company` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 246(2) someone else` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): "The registrar must give notice of having done so— (a) to the director, and (b) to every relevant company" (no "only")

